    "body": "On `pull_request` events, `actions/checkout` defaults to a detached merge commit (`refs/pull/.../merge`). That typically prevents committing/pushing fixes back to the PR branch. Configure the checkout step to fetch and checkout the PR head ref (and ensure sufficient history, e.g., `fetch-depth: 0`) so autofix can commit and push changes to the contributor branch.\n```suggestion\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v6\n        with:\n          fetch-depth: 0\n          ref: ${{ github.event.pull_request.head.sha }}\n```",
